{"id":"n67477-2-11","stage":1,"title":"뒤 · 后","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n67477-2-11-1","ko":"우리 공연이 끝나면 다같이 밥 먹을까요?","zh":"我们的演出结束后，我们一起吃饭吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"공연이","meaning":"演出，表演","explanation":"공연：演出，表演；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"공연","audio":"/audio/1c3a0a24ef01c77b9620.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62459","senseId":"1","lemma":"공연","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"끝나면","meaning":"结束，完成","explanation":"끝나다：结束，完成；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"끝나다","audio":"/audio/80a25f4e1416ded1f122.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"34734","senseId":"1","lemma":"끝나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다같이","meaning":"全，都；一起，一同","explanation":"다：全，都；같이：一起，一同","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"},{"term":"같이","audio":"/audio/d44da011993f2a6e9ba5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58175","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"26799","senseId":"1","lemma":"같이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"밥","meaning":"饭，餐","explanation":"밥：饭，餐","readings":[{"term":"밥","audio":"/audio/828fa1e7e354b408527f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62683","senseId":"2","lemma":"밥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"먹을까요?","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；을까요：礼貌地询问意见、提出建议或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"1c3a0a24ef01c77b","term":"공연","zh":"演出，表演","audio":"/audio/1c3a0a24ef01c77b9620.mp3","entryId":"62459","definition":"将歌曲、舞蹈、戏剧等展现给观众。","pronunciation":["공연"]},{"id":"80a25f4e1416ded1","term":"끝나다","zh":"结束，完成","audio":"/audio/80a25f4e1416ded1f122.mp3","entryId":"34734","definition":"事情做完。","pronunciation":["끈나다"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"全，都","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58175","definition":"无剩余或遗漏，所有的。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"d44da011993f2a6e","term":"같이","zh":"一起，一同","audio":"/audio/d44da011993f2a6e9ba5.mp3","entryId":"26799","definition":"两个以上同时。","pronunciation":["가치"]},{"id":"828fa1e7e354b408","term":"밥","zh":"饭，餐","audio":"/audio/828fa1e7e354b408527f.mp3","entryId":"62683","definition":"每天在一定时间吃的食物。","pronunciation":["밥"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将食物送进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]}],"audio":"/audio/a183d76d26e7e700950c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n67477-2-11-2","ko":"좋아요. 끝난 뒤에 모두 공연장 앞에서 모여요.","zh":"好啊。结束后大家都在演出场前面集合吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"좋아요.","meaning":"行，可以","explanation":"좋다：行，可以；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"12","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"끝난","meaning":"结束，完成","explanation":"끝나다：结束，完成；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"끝나다","audio":"/audio/80a25f4e1416ded1f122.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"34734","senseId":"1","lemma":"끝나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뒤에","meaning":"后，之后，后来","explanation":"뒤：后，之后，后来；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"뒤","audio":"/audio/c65326b2de936236c222.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67477","senseId":"2","lemma":"뒤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"모두","meaning":"全部，所有","explanation":"모두：全部，所有","readings":[{"term":"모두","audio":"/audio/2576dfb09ecb81b98258.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64739","senseId":"1","lemma":"모두","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"공연장","meaning":"剧场，演出场地","explanation":"공연장：剧场，演出场地","readings":[{"term":"공연장","audio":"/audio/607077062c5e900a7010.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25333","senseId":"1","lemma":"공연장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"앞에서","meaning":"前，前面","explanation":"앞：前，前面；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"앞","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88648","senseId":"1","lemma":"앞","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"모여요.","meaning":"被召集，被集中","explanation":"모이다：被召集，被集中；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"모이다","audio":"/audio/ea6fae0a54340254cbe6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91162","senseId":"6","lemma":"모이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"行，可以","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"某个行动或事情等不成问题。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]},{"id":"80a25f4e1416ded1","term":"끝나다","zh":"结束，完成","audio":"/audio/80a25f4e1416ded1f122.mp3","entryId":"34734","definition":"事情做完。","pronunciation":["끈나다"]},{"id":"c65326b2de936236","term":"뒤","zh":"后，之后，后来","audio":"/audio/c65326b2de936236c222.mp3","entryId":"67477","definition":"在时间或顺序上，以后或下次。","pronunciation":["뒤ː"]},{"id":"2576dfb09ecb81b9","term":"모두","zh":"全部，所有","audio":"/audio/2576dfb09ecb81b98258.mp3","entryId":"64739","definition":"一个不剩或一个不漏的全体。","pronunciation":["모두"]},{"id":"607077062c5e900a","term":"공연장","zh":"剧场，演出场地","audio":"/audio/607077062c5e900a7010.mp3","entryId":"25333","definition":"表演戏剧、歌曲、舞蹈等的地方。","pronunciation":["공연장"]},{"id":"ec1a6b96ce688b70","term":"앞","zh":"前，前面","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3","entryId":"88648","definition":"所向的一面或地方。","pronunciation":["압"]},{"id":"ea6fae0a54340254","term":"모이다","zh":"被召集，被集中","audio":"/audio/ea6fae0a54340254cbe6.mp3","entryId":"91162","definition":"人们聚集在一起或加入某个团体。","pronunciatio